    for establishing the baseline does not appear to have met for many years,
    has not recently (if ever) released a report or made a survey, and, indeed,
    may not be constituted at the moment. In its absence -- and before it was
    constituted, indeed, since the moment of creation of Lojban -- people have
    been suggesting changes, "improvements", and using these non-standard forms
    freely, with or without the cooperation or understanding of other Lojbanists.
